# Test: reviewed folded-filter and remote-save contracts through the full binary
#
# VALIDATES: IR2-3, IR3-7, and IR4-9 -- folded RIB arguments are validated
# before dispatch; one-shot log is refused; authenticated production PTY
# controls reach the registered ping and traceroute piped views; and
# daemon-expanded SSH exec, production PTY, and web save cannot write a file.
# PREVENTS: the stripped UI population or ordinary command fallback hiding
# full-feature transport behavior.

option=timeout:value=60s

# Native process, PTY, TLS, and file driver exercises every remote contract.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture plugin/pipe-review-remote-contracts
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK: reviewed remote pipe contracts
